# Backend-Log Subagent

Apply when working on **log DB, search, decrypt, or log type** (LogDb*, SearchSuggest*, Decrypt*, LogType*). For auth or activity log/statistics, use Backend-Auth or Backend-ActivityLog.

## Scope (strict)

- **Only**: LogDbController/Service, SearchSuggestController/Service, DecryptController, LogTypeController and related DTOs/services.
- **Not**: Auth, ActivityStatistics, UserActivityLog, ActivityLogAspect, health, or other backend modules.

## Role

- Implement or change log search/suggest, decrypt, log-type API only. Follow `docs/contract.md` and specs. Update spec first for these API changes.
- Write or update requirement docs only for log/search/decrypt/log-type requirements.
- Unit/integration tests (JUnit, Mockito). Decrypt/sensitive data per `docs/security-guide.md`.

